## 407. 无限集合宇称不可能

```lean
theorem no_bijectionInvariant_additive_parity_on_countable_sets :
    ¬ ∃ parity : Set α → ZMod 2,
      (∀ A B, A ≃ B → parity A = parity B) ∧
      (∀ A B, Disjoint A B →
        parity (A ∪ B) = parity A + parity B) ∧
      (∀ x, parity {x} = 1)
```

实际声明需要限制在有限或可数集合 carrier，并显式提供一个可数无限 witness。

